    "body": "I realized that `unit/helpers.lua` almost contains the code already to dump the processed ffi headers to file. With this addition\r\n\r\n    NVIM_TEST_MAIN_CDEFS=1 NVIM_TEST_PRINT_CDEF=2 make unittest\r\n\r\ngives `build/cdefs.dump.h` which can be imported as\r\n\r\n    local ffi = require'ffi'\r\n    local cdefs = io.open('build/cdefs.dump.h', 'r'):read('*all')\r\n    ffi.cdef(cdefs)\r\n\r\nI would use this to develop/test unittests interactively i e using luadev.",
    "closed_at": null,
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "should update the doc for `NVIM_TEST_PRINT_CDEF` at https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/test/README.md#configuration\r\n\r\nsomething like \r\n\r\n> when set to 2, dumps to `build/cdefs.dump.h` (useful for code completion)",
