        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "The only difference to `NVIM_TEST_PRINT_CDEF=1` appears to that it is printed to a (fixed) filename, instead of stdout.  Maybe a filename could be supported/taken instead?  (\"1\" could still mean stdout then).\r\n(I think it makes sense to reduce the number of \"new\" options/cases, and taking a filename directly makes it more flexible)\r\n\r\nMaybe it also makes sense to have a special env var for what you are doing it (`NVIM_TEST_MAIN_CDEFS=1 NVIM_TEST_PRINT_CDEF=2`)?\r\n\r\n> I would use this to develop/test unittests interactively i e using luadev.\r\n\r\nCan you elaborate, please?  Do you mean https://github.com/Metastruct/luadev?",
